          "text": "Full-page scan of the bilingual English/French first page of the Weekly Epidemiological Record, No. 43, 27 October 1978, with the WHO emblem in the masthead. It carries the article 'Meningococcal polysaccharide vaccines / Vaccins antiméningococciques polyosidiques' on the United States in two columns, and a box listing the epidemiological notes in the issue.",
